NOTE: The data set WORK._ORACLE_INPUT has 2000 observations and 5 variables.

2321       proc quantreg data=_oracle_input;
2322       by _oracle_by;
2323       model y = x1 x2 / seed=314159;
2324       run;

NOTE: No valid quantiles are specified. PROC QUANTREG computes median regression.
